'''Undies Cat Jr.''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.3 Update/JP|Patch 1.0.3]] exclusive to the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch Version]] of [[The Battle Cats]]. To obtain said unit, players would have to obtain a leaflet from the July 2020 issue from CoroCoro Comic and redeem the serial code listed inside. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]], it gained the ability to target [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemies. This unit is exclusive to the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') version.

