==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Undies Cat Sr.''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Undies Cat Jr.'s role is to supplement existing [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|Crowd-Controllers]] in your current lineup, as its slow uptime is far too low for it to be the sole source of Crowd-Controlling. Since it has quite high speed, it is best to send this unit once there are existing meatshields and Crowd-Controllers in the field, otherwise it will run ahead and die instantly. Undies Cat Jr.'s low range and [[Single Attack]] means that it is only really effective against enemies such as [[Bore]], [[J.K. Bun Bun]], [[Teacher Bun Bun]], various [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s and [[Nimoy Bore]].

Just like the rest of the CoroCoro collaboration units, it has low XP costs compared to other [[:Category:Special Cats|Special]] and [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]] which makes it a great [[User Rank]] Dump. Though its ability to slow enemies for 7 seconds may be a strong attribute, it has other characteristic flaws that stop it from being what could have been an insanely great unit.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

